app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:5308:	 (46855,4980,1,1,155,87,1,NULL,'','Immune to the physical warping caused by Emrakul, geists proved to be some of humanity''s most important allies.','巡礼者の守護霊が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは+1/+1の修整を受ける。','When Guardian of Pilgrims enters the battlefield, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.','2','2','30',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 17:33:09+09','2025-07-31 21:04:02+09'),
