app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:8303:	 (48006,2639,1,1,147,89,1,NULL,'','All of Zendikar''s beings sense the upheaval that accompanies the Eldrazi.','上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、噛み付きナーリッドは+1/+1の修整を受ける。','Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Snapping Gnarlid gets +1/+1 until end of turn.','2','2','190',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:43:48+09','2025-07-31 20:39:27+09'),
