app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:8658:	 (48166,9835,1,1,143,108,1,NULL,'','After stripping the sunken ships, it rises to the surface for another helping.','あなたの墓地にカードが７枚以上ないかぎり、深海の恐怖は攻撃できない。','Deep-Sea Terror can''t attack unless there are seven or more cards in your graveyard.','6','6','52',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:45:42+09','2025-07-31 21:20:37+09'),
