app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:14714:	 (51169,19485,1,1,116,187,1,NULL,'','The paradise of Amrou Haven had become a field of cinders. Its people struggled to survive, hoping to see visions of its past in the strange storms that quickly passed.','アムローの求道者は、アーティファクト・クリーチャーでも白でもないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。','Amrou Seekers can''t be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or white creatures.','2','2','3',1,false,0,'2019-03-14 19:09:37+09','2025-07-31 21:42:59+09'),
