app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:47599:	 (65142,8913,1,1,203,197,1,NULL,'ボガートは常に、芋虫婆と同じぐらい名を上げてやろうと、他が巣穴に持ち帰った物を越えるべく争い続けている。','Boggarts constantly strive to outdo each other with the things they bring back to the warren, each hoping the exploit will become as well-known as those of Auntie Grub.','あなたが唱える巨人(Giant)呪文は、それを唱えるためのコストが(２)少なくなる。','Giant spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.','1','3','119',0,false,0,'2019-03-15 21:46:03+09','2025-07-31 21:16:29+09'),
