app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:50058:','It rarely moves, standing stock still in its clearing. When it does stir, ravens stop their cawing and crickets their chirping. All of nature watches in awed silence.','威厳の魔力が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする緑のクリーチャー１体につきカードを１枚引く。','When Regal Force enters the battlefield, draw a card for each green creature you control.','5','5','22',0,false,0,'2019-03-15 23:03:48+09','2025-07-31 21:04:43+09'),
