app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:27320:	 (56152,12747,1,1,70,89,1,NULL,'エルフの戦士は小川を飛び越える鹿のように優雅であり、それを反対側で待ち受ける狼のように危険だ。彼らは森の眼であり、むき出しの爪なのだ。','As graceful as a deer leaping a stream and as deadly as the wolf waiting in ambush on the other side, elvish warriors are the eyes of the forest as well as its unsheathed claws.','0','0','2','3','120',1,false,0,'2019-03-14 19:41:56+09','2025-07-31 21:28:07+09'),
